%N A402544 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} O(k-1)/(k+1)^3, where O(k) = A350669(k)/A350670(k) is the k-th odd harmonic number (or harmonic number of the second kind).
%H A402544 Anthony Sofo and Amrik Singh Nimbran, <a href="https://doi.org/10.3390/math7090833">Euler sums and integral connections</a>, Mathematics, Vol. 7, No. 9 (2019), Article 833. See p. 16.
